          {"option_id": "d", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Counting one extra ratio step gives exponents 3 and 6, hence 13*(-27)=-351 and 13*729=9477.", "misconception": "Count both anchor and target as transitions, adding one to each gap."}
        ]
