    {
      "id": "q10",
      "source_numbers": ["287"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "等比数列 $(c_n)$ 中，$c_5=27$，$c_4=9$。$c_8$ 等于多少？",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {"id": "a", "text": "$243$", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "b", "text": "$729$", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "c", "text": "$1$", "figure_ids": []},
          {"id": "d", "text": "$81$", "figure_ids": []}
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "Infer a common ratio from adjacent known terms and advance to the eighth term.",
        "source_solution": "q=c_5/c_4=27/9=3. Then c_8=c_5 q^3=27*27=729; equivalently c_4 q^4=9*81=729.",
        "unit_reason": "Ratio inference and forward computation are dependent parts of one scalar task, not independent response units.",
        "concept_blocks": [1],
        "limitations": ["Recognition does not demonstrate independently writing the inferred ratio and subsequent power calculation."],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": ["b"],
        "rationales": [
          {"option_id": "a", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Correctly obtain q=3 but count only two steps from index 5 to 8, giving 27*3^2=243.", "misconception": "Subtract an extra 1 from the difference between two already specified indices."},
          {"option_id": "b", "truth": "correct", "derivation": "q=27/9=3; there are three steps after c_5, so c_8=27*3^3=729.", "misconception": null},
          {"option_id": "c", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Use c_4/c_5=1/3 as the forward ratio, giving 27*(1/3)^3=1.", "misconception": "Reverse the adjacent-term quotient when determining the forward ratio."},
          {"option_id": "d", "truth": "incorrect", "derivation": "Treat 27-9=18 as an additive common difference, then use c_8=27+3*18=81.", "misconception": "Infer an arithmetic progression from the two known adjacent terms instead of a geometric progression."}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q11",
      "source_numbers": ["288"],
      "view": {
        "mode": "single",
        "stem": "四个等比数列的首项、公比和某一项的值分别如下：\n\n| 数列 | 首项 | 公比 | 某一项的值 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| A | $2$ | $3$ | $162$ |\n| B | $640$ | $\\frac12$ | $10$ |\n| C | $1$ | $\\frac13$ | $\\frac1{81}$ |\n| D | $2$ | $0.1$ | $0.002$ |\n\n按 A、B、C、D 的顺序，这些项的序号组成哪一组？",
        "figure_ids": [],
