        "source_solution": "a: q=0.3/0.1=3 and 0.1*3^(n-1)=218.7 => 3^(n-1)=2187=3^7 => n=8. b: q=640/1280=1/2 and 1280*(1/2)^(n-1)=20 => (1/2)^(n-1)=1/64=(1/2)^6 => n=7.",
