      "intent": {
        "task": "Convert elapsed hours into division periods and compute the resulting population from one initial bacterium.",
        "source_solution": "10/(1/2)=20 division periods. With N_0=1 and N_(t+1)=2N_t, N_20=2^20=1048576. If numbered as a sequence whose first term is the initial count, this is term 21, but the exponent is 20.",
